// /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/99halow-kernel-guard — detect an orphaned morse.ko
// at the causal moment (covers unattended-upgrades too). MUST never block
// or fail apt: detection is milliseconds, rebuilds dispatch async via
// systemd-run, and the unconditional '|| true' is load-bearing — a failing
// Post-Invoke breaks package management on a remote gateway.
DPkg::Post-Invoke { "/usr/local/bin/halow-kernel-guard check --dispatch || true"; };
